# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/

# Apache Hop (3_Hop_ETL)
3_Hop_ETL/.hop/
3_Hop_ETL/*.log
3_Hop_ETL/hop-check.txt
3_Hop_ETL/.DS_Store
3_Hop_ETL/Thumbs.db

# Ignore execution data and local logs (repo-wide)
*.log
hop-check.txt

# Ignore OS specific files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Official Hop Project — A_datasets (tải lại bằng A_datasets/download_datasets.sh)
4_Official_Hop_Project/A_datasets/A1_citibike/*.zip
4_Official_Hop_Project/A_datasets/A1_citibike/extracted/
4_Official_Hop_Project/A_datasets/A2_divvy/*.zip
4_Official_Hop_Project/A_datasets/A2_divvy/extracted/
4_Official_Hop_Project/A_datasets/A3_noaa_lcd_v2/*.csv
4_Official_Hop_Project/A_datasets/A4_mdm_station_info/*.json
4_Official_Hop_Project/A_datasets/manifest.json